  "prefLabel": "Ph 2107.03 Inspection Frequency for Practitioners",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2107.03 Inspection Frequency for Practitioners. Practitioner inspections shall occur based on a risk assessment level assigned by pharmacy board compliance staff based on the factors in Ph 2107.04 through 2107.06.\n\nSource. #13028, eff 4-11-20",
